      "content": "it's not just the work though. i feel like my whole identity is tied to this. if i'm not a researcher, then who am i? i feel like i've just been wasting everyone's time, including my own. it's like i've reached a dead end and there's no way to turn back. everything feels so empty now. why even bother trying to fix it or start over?",
